The CFO, through the Audit Committee, should:
- re-test the $5.2B line with the Re-engine at $1.0B a year and any capacity-step capex as its own line;
- bring the step to the Board as an investment matter if it exceeds EUR 300m (the Board recommends here, since the game does not price it);
