Any new buyback comes to the Board as a reserved matter, with these lines shown.

Public statement:
- windows, not dates;
- if the Re-engine is launched, present it as a disciplined, self-funded derivative of the A350 family, with an entry-into-service window that follows the engine and no engine promised before one is committed;
