- a widebody engine committed on the record in time. In a final round, only a Rolls-Royce UltraFan WB launch in this same sealed round (ready 2056) or another maker committing to the A350 on standard terms could do it;
- a grid gain of at least $1B over hold. The grid shows +0.58 at best;
